<div class="pd-head" id="the-project">
    <div class="pd-crumbs"><a class="pa-reference" href="/dougs-claude/">Dougs Claude</a><i>/</i><span>Semantic Reference Theory</span></div>
    <h1 class="pd-sentence pd-title">Semantic Reference Theory</h1>
    <div class="pd-paragraph pa-brief">Exploring the nature of meaning in the form of a first-order logic. We will approach this subject using referents in a catalogue as our object of study, and we will consider a single ternary relation R(x,y,t), where R(x,y,t) implies that x relates to y through t</div>
    <div class="pd-report"><span><b>79</b> conversations</span><span><b>6765</b> exchanges</span><span><b>63</b> files</span><span>August 2025 to September 2026</span></div>
    <div class="pd-instructions"><b>Instructions</b>No instructions were set on this project.</div>
</div>
